title: Field Notes
subtitle: Our observations and reflections on life
description: Field notes from Yomonsni's coaches: short essays on discipline, change, creativity, leadership, and intimacy, drawn from our own lives and practice.
+++

This is a collection of our notes on life. As we are constantly learning, observing, experimenting, exploring, and reflecting, we use writing as a tool to help figure out what we're uncovering. These are often raw, drawn on our own lives, or things we've learned from our parents, friends, coaches, or from working with our clients.

We hope that at least some of these will resonate for you in some way, or send you down your own path of exploration and meaning finding. We're not trying to give answers, but to help you learn the right questions for yourself and your own journey through life. 

New notes are added regularly, newest first. At the foot of each note you'll find the areas of coaching it speaks to, as well as a link to set up a time to talk to the coach who wrote it if you'd like to take the question further with us.


